## Secrets and local environment: never commit these.
.env
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key
secrets*.json
appsettings.*.local.json

## Terraform: never commit state, plans, local variables or credentials.
## .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed (it pins provider versions and checksums).
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
crash.log
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
